WEBVTT

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.734
By 7:08, I started to black out.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.976
And by seven minutes and 30 seconds,

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.432
they had to pull my body out
and bring me back.

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.976
I had failed on every level.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.976
(Laughter)

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:54.878
So, naturally, the only way out
of the slump that I could think of was,

00:10:54.959 --> 00:10:57.422
I decided to call Oprah.

00:10:57.446 --> 00:11:00.883
(Laughter)